OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol consumption scorecard to
OL,4,Ahelp track intake
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alcohol consumption campaign with
OL,7,Fscorecards to monitor units, is aimed
OL,8,Fat helping islanders make informed
OL,9,Fdecisions about their health.
OL,11,FThe Rethink Your Drink scheme, set up
OL,12,Fby the Health Improvement Commission
OL,13,Ffor Guernsey and Alderney, encourages
OL,14,Fresidents to fill in scorecards noting
OL,15,Ftheir weekly alcohol intake and compare
OL,16,Fthe results to the recommended
OL,17,Fguidelines.
OL,19,FThe charity said islanders will receive
OL,20,Fa scorecard through their letterbox.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
