OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol consumption scorecard to
OL,4,Ahelp track intake
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrea Nightingale, substance use lead
OL,7,Fat the Health Improvement Commission,
OL,8,Fsaid the scorecard was "a simple,
OL,9,Finteractive and engaging way to help
OL,10,Fpeople understand their intake".
